%%begintext align
%%Continuing the tradition can be interpreted in several ways. I have chosen two.
%%Tunes composed by contemporary musicians in the traditional style,
%%and tunes collected from where ever that are heard and liked
%%and played and so find their way into lounge rooms and sessions.
