%%They are not necessarily arranged in playable sets.
%%endtext
X:7
T:Railway Hotel
% NFF Book 2008
S:collected from Bert Shields, Unanderra, NSW
S:collected by Alan Musgrove
H:Bert Shields, of Unaderra, (near Wollongong) NSW, played this to 
H:Alan Musgrove about 30 years ago (c.1980). Bert learned this tune 
H:in a session that took place regularly at the Railway Hotel in 
H:Ivanhoe, NSW, when he was working on the Railways. 
O:Australia, NSW, Unanderra
R:Set Tune
F:Railway_Hotel.mp3 Railway Hotel - played by Greg O'Leary
